    Bug 1998428 - Expose NTLM as an available authentication method for EWS accounts. r=edicharry

    I've had to slightly tweak the authentication error handling so the NTLM auth
    flow is run at least once. The first request will likely always fail since we
    don't have an authentication cookie set yet, meaning the connectivity check
    would always fail.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D275770

